## 🔬 Practical Methodology

### Phase 1 — PDF Hash Extraction

Each supplied PDF was processed with the NetworkWalks Hash Calculator. The tool produced a hash in PDF-compatible `$pdf$` format.

The extracted hashes were saved separately:

```text
hashes/
├── PDF1.hash
├── PDF2.hash
└── PDF3.hash
```

**Evidence — PDF hash extraction**

